 is art.","id":"609868179121","source":"BTS 1 · #55"},"3a26373c0426":{"text":"Physical education is exciting.","id":"3a26373c0426","source":"BTS 1 · #57"},"c5b9457c7b91":{"text":"We play games in P.E. class.","id":"c5b9457c7b91","source":"BTS 1 · #58","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/31d64c53-7eea-4d73-88e7-e940f2bfb229.webp","imageBytes":15466},"f257b4b980d2":{"text":"Our teacher gives us homework.","id":"f257b4b980d2","source":"BTS 1 · #59"},"3457ea5d33aa":{"id":"3457ea5d33aa","source":"BTS 16 · #16","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/acf8cba6-f3ac-4764-9d62-2b4efac82738.webp","imageBytes":16084,"video":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/82768f9a-0d2d-4b83-95ad-e80642bfc47d.mp4","videoBytes":154984,"duration":5.875},"541c9909ab5f":{"text":"I do my homework at home.","id":"541c9909ab5f","source":"BTS 1 · #60"},"f691aeec8ff7":{"text":"Do you finish your homework?","id":"f691aeec8ff7","source":"BTS 1 · #61"},"eb56c513e1f7":{"text":"Yes, I always finish my homework.","id":"eb56c513e1f7","source":"BTS 1 · #62"},"a6e6325c1498":{"text":"She helps us understand the lesson.","id":"a6e6325c1498","source":"BTS 1 · #64"},"b1a3f213bbc4":{"text":"He explains everything clearly.","id":"b1a3f213bbc4","source":"BTS 1 · #65","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/f8eb689a-1b8b-48ed-8056-0fbd1d138422.webp","imageBytes":12090},"67c7a598561a":{"text":"The lessons are easy to understand.","id":"67c7a598561a","source":"BTS 1 · #66","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/c2e8b46d-b0b6-4255-a195-00710bef3d73.webp","imageBytes":21178},"b7ace8529dcb":{"text":"I have many friends at school.","id":"b7ace8529dcb","source":"BTS 1 · #67"},"2228f5afe82e":{"id":"2228f5afe82e","source":"BTS 32 · #17","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/faf03b99-294e-4a70-b776-b112b39ed749.webp","imageBytes":22128,"video":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/1bc88374-c728-4eee-ab2d-a2decfeb2c99.mp4","videoBytes":182068,"duration":5.875},"54506b5130d8":{"text":"We sit together in class.","id":"54506b5130d8","source":"BTS 1 · #69"},"2cf48475a23d":{"text":"We study together after school.","id":"2cf48475a23d","source":"BTS 1 · #70"},"e8f8fd9c2677":{"text":"The bell rings at three o'clock.","id":"e8f8fd9c2677","source":"BTS 1 · #71"},"5d12864b9b67":{"text":"School ends at three thirty.","id":"5d12864b9b67","source":"BTS 1 · #72","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/e5102fb3-4931-4274-8158-f40e65844625.webp","imageBytes":15634},"8d5efa790d90":{"id":"8d5efa790d90","source":"BTS 33 · #14","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/0248fa17-7ee0-42e6-bbc4-4061a2b3a2e3.webp","imageBytes":16662,"video":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/477dbb74-444f-486a-aea4-a0eff5c4ade1.mp4","videoBytes":255079,"duration":5.875},"25589a41c4f9":{"text":"The school bus is big.","id":"25589a41c4f9","source":"BTS 1 · #74"},"6454bbb67bb2":{"text":"The bus driver is friendly.","id":"6454bbb67bb2","source":"BTS 1 · #75","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/aab09f83-ead7-4f3c-a881-043d88878362.webp","imageBytes":15604},"e41eddadd882":{"text":"I see you at school tomorrow.","id":"e41eddadd882","source":"BTS 1 · #76"},"8d9a76b5bb9b":{"text":"Goodbye, everyone!","id":"8d9a76b5bb9b","source":"BTS 1 · #78"},"c17b3ab5d807":{"text":"Have a good day!","id":"c17b3ab5d807","source":"BTS 1 · #79"},"47c1d6734534":{"text":"See you later!","id":"47c1d6734534","source":"BTS 1 · #80"},"60974f04a523":{"text":"I am ready for school.","id":"60974f04a523","source":"BTS 1 · #81","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/7de115c7-33c7-489b-8b69-3b422c2